                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misiri pi, Yuda pie, ’Edomu pie, Amoni anziyi pie, Moa­bu pie, ’ba yi ma dribi ti fapi kalasi kalasi, ovupi angu roko driaria ’diyi be dria; a’disiku suru dria yi lini agele ku, te ori’ba dria Israelini ma asi ovu likokoru.",
          "type": "text",
